Package: amneziawg-merlin-addon
Version: @VERSION@
Source: https://github.com/r0otx/asuswrt-merlin-amneziawg
License: MIT
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: r00t <r00tx@mail.ru>
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: amneziawg-tools (>= @VERSION@), iptables, ipset, iproute2, conntrack-tools, dnsmasq, jq, curl
Description: Asuswrt-Merlin WebUI integration for AmneziaWG.
 Installs amneziawg management scripts under /jffs/addons/amneziawg,
 mounts a page under VPN -> AmneziaWG in the Merlin WebUI, and wires up
 service-event / firewall-start / wan-event / services-start hooks.
 Requires amneziawg-tools and Asuswrt-Merlin with addon support (am_addons
 in rc_support).
